---
description: >-
  `layout: swimlane` on a class diagram (D535: any graph diagram may select
  the swimlane engine). Each top-level namespace is a lane, laid side by
  side across the flow and stretched to the same length; the classes keep
  their own drawing. Lanes are flowchart's drawing, so the namespaces stay
  class's plain boxes.
config:
  layout: swimlane
---
classDiagram
  namespace Domain {
    class Order {
      +id: string
      +total() number
    }
    class Line
  }
  namespace Infra {
    class Repo {
      +save(order) void
    }
    class Db
  }
  Order *-- Line
  Repo ..> Order
  Repo --> Db
